  "description": "meme-id: brett_kavanaugh_grabbed_my_penis; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young boy in a vintage outfit standing on a stool in a barren landscape, shouting into a megaphone. The text overlay reads 'brett kavanaugh' at the top and 'grabbed my penis' at the bottom. The visual of a child shouting into a megaphone is juxtaposed with the explicit, vulgar text to create a crude, mocking, and abusive portrayal of Brett Kavanaugh. The meme uses a childish, absurd visual to mock Kavanaugh, implying he is a figure of childish or base behavior. The explicit nature of the text ('grabbed my penis') is intended to be shocking and degrading, targeting Kavanaugh personally and directly. This constitutes abusive intent as it uses vulgar language and a demeaning metaphor to attack an individual, aiming to insult and provoke a negative emotional response. The meme does not target a protected group based on race, gender, religion, etc., but rather targets an individual in a highly personal and vulgar manner, which falls under abusive content.",
